      "category": "Text",
      "text": "During the legislative session, Mr. Condello will refer bills to you for analysis as to what effect their enactment would have on the City Government. You are urged to give these bills your prompt attention, especially when you are of the opinion that enactment of the bill would mandate City expense, curtail City revenues or would be otherwise detrimental to the City Government. Send the original and one copy of your report to Mr. Condello at the Albany office, and two copies to City Hall.",
